  * Features:
    - Docker/Podman container management for Hexo
    - Multiple blog creation and management
    - Theme gallery with popular Hexo themes
    - Plugin management (sitemap, RSS, search, etc.)
    - Post editor with markdown preview
    - Draft/publish workflow
    - Preview server with live reload
